gttx://索引|文档.docs.FUXI_DICTIONARY_TRINITY_BRIDGE.md|14|83320CF799CB7209|pub unicode: u32,         // Unicode 标量值
gttx://索引|文档.docs.FUXI_DICTIONARY_TRINITY_BRIDGE.md|15|B39FA444FC772151|pub code: ContainerCode,  // 容器码(家族/极性/结构/声母/韵母/声调)
gttx://索引|文档.docs.FUXI_DICTIONARY_TRINITY_BRIDGE.md|16|42B2B3C68931DB5E|pub coord: MaoriCoord,    // 毛利兰立体坐标
gttx://索引|文档.docs.FUXI_DICTIONARY_TRINITY_BRIDGE.md|17|41A945DED7DF3985|pub cref: ContainerRef,   // 容器中间表示
gttx://索引|文档.docs.FUXI_DICTIONARY_TRINITY_BRIDGE.md|18|9A4DBB43EEBF7839|pub label: String,        // 显示标签
gttx://索引|文档.docs.FUXI_DICTIONARY_TRINITY_BRIDGE.md|22|16220596DD933F8D|一枚汉字就是一座六路桥梁: visual form → unicode scalar → distance code → 3D space → universal IR → label. 任意一路改变, 其余五路都能通过重新计算 FNV-1a 立即看出变动.
