gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|368|2A74DC242F1970AE|compute_morphisms(table):
gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|369|FFB66934B9536F68|for each row in table:
gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|371|8D2F40B695506481|continue  # 空质壳不参与态射运算,由挂载逻辑处理
