gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|376|520AC4164291C775|d_coord = abs(row.C1 - other_row.C1)
gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|377|658714E087807D2A|d_view  = (row.C3 == other_row.C3) ? 0 : 1
gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|378|0F1FF6F9C5301660|d_level = abs(row.level - other_row.level)
gttx://索引|文档.docs.MORPHISM_ALGEBRA.md|379|EBD9D41757C4E257|C_eff   = d_coord/255.0 + d_view + d_level/7.0
