gttx://索引|文档.docs.MACRO_ISA_MACRO_MACHINE_CODE.md|74|2E53B889366C14F2|¦ Yunmu ¦ 39 (39 韵母) ¦ a/o/e/i/u/v/ai/ei/... ¦
